## The same talk in both

The following table summarizes the differences between both versions:

| | reveal.js | lhtml-site |
|---|---|---|
| The slides | one HTML file, a `<section>` per slide | a folder per slide, `index.html.j2` |
| A model | `<iframe class="demo" data-src="demos/c3/index.html?...">` | `demo::../_demo/c3/index.html?...` |
| Text and model side by side | a grid in the style of the page | the layout `side` |
| Buttons in a slide | name their model: `data-demo="#surface"` | drive the model of the slide |
| The PDF | the printing of reveal.js | `slides-pdf`, with an image of each model |

